ependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In a YSQL-enabled YugaByte DB, when a table is created and then dropped within the same session, the session may terminate unexpectedly. For example,\r\n\r\n```\r\npostgres=# CREATE TABLE yb_char_in_key (ck CHAR PRIMARY KEY);\r\nCREATE TABLE\r\npostgres=# INSERT INTO yb_char_in_key VALUES ('a');\r\n...\r\npostgres=# DROP TABLE yb_char_in_key;\r\nserver closed the connection unexpectedly\r\n\tThis probably means the server terminated abnormally\r\n\tbefore or while processing the request.\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"robertpang","id":30942926,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTQyOTI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30942926?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang","html_url":"https://github.com/robertpang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/865/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/865/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}